! Groups
! 
! $Group n             Channel group n
! 
!    Text              Group label
! 
!    $$ChanList        List of channels in group
!    $$SubChanList     Subgroup list (if present)
 
$Group 1
   Text All Moving
   $$ChanList      1     2     3     4     5    11    12    13    14    15
   $$ChanList     16    21    22    23    24    25    26    41    42    43
   $$ChanList     44    45
 
$Group 2
   Text Group 2
   $$ChanList      3     1     2
 
$Group 3
   Text Group 3
   $$ChanList      4     5
 
$Group 10
   Text Group 10
   $$ChanList     15    16    11    12    13    14
 
$Group 20
   Text Group 20
   $$ChanList     21    22    23    24    25    26
 
$Group 30
   Text Group 30
   $$ChanList     35    36    31    32    33    34
 
$Group 40
   Text Group 40
   $$ChanList     44    41    42    43    45
 
